            "credential_configuration_id": "person_identification_data_(pid)_1.0.0_mdoc",
            "notes": "Minted through the playground's (playground.hovi.id) Supabase edge function issue-credential, which answers without any key. The playground's page also sends Supabase's public anon key; it is not used here. credentialType is the playground's own name for the configuration; the sessionId must be new on every call. Photo ID, Age Verification, Health ID and LPID are in the metadata too, but their credentialType names are only listed in a table the anon key guards, so they have no row yet.",
